  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Synthetic passive with",
   "texto": [
    "With a transient verb, **se** can form a passive: **Vende-se pão fresco** equals «the fresh bread is sold»; **Vendem-se casas** equals «houses are sold». The name that the action receives is the subject, so the verb matches him."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Undetermined subject",
   "texto": [
    "In **Precisa-se de empregados** (personal needs), the verb remains in singular: **de empregados** is introduced by preposition and is not the subject of a passive. Also: **Trabalha-se muito aqui** (here you work a lot). In negative, the pronoun goes ahead: **não se fuma**."
   ]
  },
